  "title": "SaaS growth: connect search demand with qualified demos | Fyntix",
  "description": "Connect SaaS search and campaign activity with customer fit, useful product explanations and a clearly defined demo or sales conversation.",
  "classes": "page-shell w-full relative min-h-screen pointer-events-auto",
